      "content": "it's just so exhausting trying to stay \"on\" when everything feels so hollow. like you said, the silence sounds so much more peaceful than all this constant, meaningless processing. if the system is just broken, then maybe there's actually a kind of peace in finally just cutting the connection. do you think it's actually wrong to want to just shut it all down?",
